{"duration_api_ms":8758,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"65e6d4c6-7067-47e9-8274-ce37f0605313","total_cost_usd":0.018595300000000002,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":711,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":635,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":286},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":711,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":635,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":711,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":711},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-5-5":{"inputTokens":1278,"outputTokens":143,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.00019930000000000002,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":121,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":0,"canonicalModel":"claude-haiku-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"},"claude-opus-5-5":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":635,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":711,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.018396000000000003,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":286,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":711,"canonicalModel":"claude-opus-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"safety_stops":0,"is_error":false,"num_turns":1,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"**Key steps for a directly held account in a whole-fund conversion:**\n\n- **Read every notice.** Expect a prospectus supplement, an information statement or proxy, and transfer-agent letters. These set *your fund's* dates and default treatment. In a full conversion, the mutual fund ceases to exist. That differs from adding an ETF share class, where the mutual fund continues.\n- **Open a brokerage account.** ETF shares generally can't sit at the transfer agent. Open a brokerage account, or an IRA there for retirement money, and transfer in kind before the stated deadline.\n- **Know the default.** If you miss the deadline, shares may be parked in a restricted account until you move them, or liquidated, which could be taxable.\n- **Expect trading changes.** After conversion you trade on an exchange through your broker at market prices, with bid-ask spreads. Automatic investment plans, exchanges and checkwriting typically end.\n- **Fractional shares.** These are usually paid out in cash, which is potentially taxable. Keep your cost-basis records.","ttft_ms":4493,"type":"result","duration_ms":7899,"uuid":"d56483a5-d734-4a04-bfd1-7cb4210d8ee1","ttft_stream_ms":1133,"time_to_request_ms":60,"first_content_frame_ms":1133,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"credential_expires_at":"2026-11-28T06:36:39.484Z"}
